Node ID=2 the surgeon
Text=<He does not look up from the man he is working on.> If you can walk you can wait. <Then he sees what you are, and he wipes his hands.> Or you are the one Sir Roger went off with, in which case sit down and let me see it.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Templar IS
Reply Text=I am of the Temple, brother. Do what you can.
Go to node ID=4 healed
Custom Action=CGiveHealthToCharacterAction
{
