Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will manage.
Go to node ID=
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=3 whose stock
Text=Men who came up that road with us. <He does not stop packing.> The Order buys in bulk and buries in bulk, and I would rather it went into somebody who is still standing.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then let me see it.
Go to node ID=1 the quartermaster
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=4 healed
Text=<Whatever he does takes less time than it should, and hurts more than you expect.> There. Do not make me do that twice in one day -- I have others.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=My thanks.
Go to node ID=
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=5 the tally
Text=Twenty at the gate, and I knew nineteen of them by name. <He goes back to the man on the ground.> The druids do not take wounded, so there is no one to trade for and nothing to negotiate. Kill them and come back and I will still be here.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will.
Go to node ID=2 the surgeon
Is Default Reply=1
}
